Cell[TextData[StyleBox["H1, H2, K  are expressed by the combination of H0, W, \
V and the background quantities, p0, \[Rho]0, \[Nu], and \[Lambda], with a \
given out-of-equilibrium contribution. This means that solving the equations \
for H0, W, V determines all the perturbation variables.",
 FontSize->24]], "Text",
